message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "RadicalMap: Extremist Content Network Mapping Instrument"
abstract: >-
  A research instrument for detecting, classifying, and visualising
  extremist content networks on short-form video platforms, using only
  publicly accessible metadata. Independent academic research; not
  affiliated with, commissioned by, or conducted on behalf of any
  organisation, institution, research body, platform, government agency,
  or third party.
